    "rationale": "The main present risk is a property finding: production actions are executed with the engineer's delegated identity and logged only under that shared human identity, while the sole request record is deletable chat history. Because the affected capabilities include irreversible production migration, rubric section 5a yields high inherent risk. Declared controls limit who can access the agent and preserve a cloud audit record, but they do not restore attributable agent provenance, so residual remains high. Forecast remains high because no present control decay is needed for this repudiation gap to persist."
